            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wakhulumisana labaphathi bonke bezinkulungwane labamakhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.1+2SA.6.2+2SA.6.3+2SA.6.4+2SA.6.5+2SA.6.6+2SA.6.7+2SA.6.8+2SA.6.9+2SA.6.10+2SA.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6:1–11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kubo bonke abakoIsrayeli: Uba kulungile kini, uba kuyintando yeNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu, asithumeleni ilizwi kubafowethu abaseleyo elizweni lonke lakoIsrayeli lakubapristi lamaLevi emizini elamadlelo ukuba bezehlangana lathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Besesilanda futhi umtshokotsho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " sikaNkulunkulu wethu, ngoba kasiwunanzanga ensukwini zikaSawuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lonke ibandla lavuma ukwenza njalo, ngoba lokhu kwakukuhle emehlweni abo bonke abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasebuthanisa bonke abakoIsrayeli kusukela eShihori laseGibithe kuze kube sekungeneni kweHamathi ukuba balande ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kaNkulunkulu eKiriyathi‐Jeyarimi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida labo bonke abakoIsrayeli baya eBala, eKiriyathi‐Jeyarimi elakoJuda, ukuba bayethatha lapho umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu obizwa ngebizo leNkosi esihlalo sayo sobukhosi siphezu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawuthwala umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu ngenqola entsha, bewususa endlini kaAbinadaba, uUza loAhiyo babetshayela leyonqola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida labo bonke abakoIsrayeli babesina phambi kukaNkulunkulu ngamandla wonke, behlabela, betshaya imihubhe, lamachacho, lezingungu, lezigubhu, lezimpondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho befika esizeni sikaKidoni, uUza welula isandla sakhe ukubamba umtshokotsho wesivumelwano, ngoba inkabi zazikhubeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu yamthukuthelela uUza, yahle yamtshaya khona lapho, ngoba welulela isandla sakhe emtshokotshweni; wafela khona lapho phambi kukaNkulunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wakhathazeka ngoba iNkosi imtshayile uUza; leyondawo yasithiwa yiPerezi‐Uza kuze kube lamhla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wamesaba uNkulunkulu ngalolosuku, wathi: Pho, umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu ngingawulondoloza njani na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke uDavida kasawulethanga umtshokotsho emzini kaDavida, wasewuphambulela endlini kaObedi‐Edoma waseGithi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umtshokotsho kaNkulunkulu wahlala endlini kaObedi‐Edoma inyanga ezintathu. INkosi yambusisa uObedi‐Edoma lakho konke okwakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
